#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Consentaro saves that choice and only then loads Google Tag Manager (if you use it)."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Store tracking (like “add to cart”) only runs when the visitor allowed it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "You do not need to be a developer. Fill in a few settings, save, and test once in a private browser window."
