msgid "How the banner works"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Visitor allows analytics and ads-related storage."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Visitor refuses optional tracking. Essential site functions still work."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Visitor picks categories one by one, then saves."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "After a choice, the banner hides and the decision is remembered (so they are not asked again every visit)."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Google Tag Manager (GTM)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "GTM is a toolbox that loads your analytics and ad tags."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Consentaro waits for a visitor choice before loading GTM when a banner is shown. That way tags do not fire before permission."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "If someone already chose earlier, GTM can load right away on the next visit."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Tip: after saving your GTM ID, open your site → Accept → check the browser Network tab for gtm.js."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Location / EU banner"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "The plugin tries to learn the visitor’s country in a light way (for example via your CDN or server, and a small backup lookup if needed)."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "This helps show the banner where privacy rules usually expect a clear choice."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "On a local test site, country may show as unknown — the banner can still appear so you can test easily."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "WooCommerce shop events"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "If you sell with WooCommerce, Consentaro can send helpful shop events (view product, add to cart, purchase) into the data layer — only when the visitor allowed it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Add to cart / view product need analytics permission."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Purchase needs both analytics and ads-related permission."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "No extra setup is required beyond enabling Consentaro and connecting GTM if you use it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Common questions"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "I do not see the banner on my site"
msgstr ""

#: assets/build/admin.js:9
msgid "Try a private/incognito window (old choices may be saved). Confirm Consentaro is enabled. If Geo is on and you are outside the EU, the banner may stay hidden on purpose — turn Geo off temporarily to test."
